{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And I have heard concerning you, saying, you can understand a dream to interpret it.</b> Understand this from the language of (Deuteronomy 6): ״שמע ישראל״ — 'Hear, O Israel' — which has the sense of contemplation; that is, you possess the power of wisdom and understanding to interpret the dream. So too it was said to Belshazzar concerning Daniel (Daniel 5:16): ״ואנה שמעת עליך די תוכל פשרין למפשר וקטרין למשרא״."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:19:17.499389331Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}